     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "After thyroidectomy for GD: check calcium ± iPTH and give oral calcium + calcitriol based on results, or prophylactic calcium ± calcitriol empirically."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
